<title>HONG KONG: Raymond Industrial 1996 net down 1.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Raymond Industrial 1996 net down 1.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. dollar)	  0.12	vs 0.12</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	 vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.47 loss vs 4.53 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    29.81     vs 30.27</p>
<p>    Turnover		     585.79    vs 538.26</p>
<p>    Company name		 Raymond Industrial Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 10-13</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Raymond Industrial is a home appliance maker.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represented transportation and other incidental costs incurred during the relocation of the group's major manufacturing plant.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is eight H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs same.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
